# 02 Adapter 骨架任务包

## 目标

为所有外部项目建立统一 Adapter 层，防止依赖污染核心。

## 目录

```text
backend/pk_radar/adapters/
├── converters/
├── crawlers/
├── vector/
├── llm/
├── observability/
├── memory/
├── graph/
└── security/
```

## 基础接口

### BaseAdapter

```python
from dataclasses import dataclass
from typing import Protocol

@dataclass
class AdapterStatus:
    name: str
    available: bool
    version: str | None = None
    reason: str | None = None

class BaseAdapter(Protocol):
    name: str
    def status(self) -> AdapterStatus: ...
```

### Converter

```python
@dataclass
class ConvertedDocument:
    title: str
    content_markdown: str
    content_text: str
    source_path: str
    mime_type: str
    metadata: dict
    converter: str
    quality_score: float
    warnings: list[str]

class DocumentConverter(BaseAdapter, Protocol):
    def supports(self, path: str) -> bool: ...
    def convert(self, path: str) -> ConvertedDocument: ...
```

### Crawler

```python
@dataclass
class CrawlResult:
    url: str
    title: str
    content_markdown: str
    content_text: str
    metadata: dict
    crawler: str
    quality_score: float
    warnings: list[str]

class CrawlerAdapter(BaseAdapter, Protocol):
    def fetch(self, url: str, options: dict) -> CrawlResult: ...
```

### VectorStore

```python
@dataclass
class VectorSearchResult:
    chunk_id: int
    document_id: int
    score: float
    text: str
    metadata: dict

class VectorStoreAdapter(BaseAdapter, Protocol):
    def upsert(self, chunk_id: int, vector: list[float], metadata: dict) -> None: ...
    def search(self, vector: list[float], limit: int = 10) -> list[VectorSearchResult]: ...
```

## 必须实现的 Stub

```text
MarkItDownConverter
DoclingConverter
Crawl4AIAdapter
SQLiteVecAdapter
LiteLLMAdapter
LangfuseAdapter
LocalMemoryAdapter
```

## 验收

```bash
pytest backend/tests/test_adapters.py
```

测试点：

```text
1. Adapter status 可返回 available=false
2. 未安装依赖时不崩溃
3. Registry 能按名称选择 adapter
4. fallback 生效
```


